{
  "id": "DEU.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Okoiranerera 22",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korarore eng’ombe y’oyomino gose eng’ondi yaye ekogenda gosira, tobaisa koombia buna toyerochi, korende goika oyeiranie gochia ase omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye tamenyeti ang’e naye gose tomomanyeti, goika oyerente bwoo ebeere aroro goika oria omino ache koyerigia, erio omoyee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo orakore koranyore etigere yaye, gose eanga yaye, gose gento kende gionsi ki’oyomino gesirete; aye kogokenyora tobaisa koombia tomogekoonyera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koranyore etigere y’oyomino yaguure inse agwo ase enchera, gose eng’ombe yaye, tobaisa koombia oyetige aroro; goika oyegororokie etenene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omokungu tabaisa kobeeka chianga chi’omosaacha, gose omosacha tabaisa kobeeka echi’omokuungu. Onde bwensi orakore bo, nigo arakore ayaare okogeechia ase Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Keraabe ng’a kwanyoorire egeswa ki’enyoni kere igoro ase omote, gose inse ase riroba, na onyoore enyoni eng’ina eraire igoro ase amage aye, gose ase amagena, tobaisa koira enyoni eria amo n’amage aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oire amage oka, korende eng’ina ero oyetige eiruruke egende. Korakore igo n’ebe buya ase ore, naende n’obe moyo ase engaki entambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero okoagaacha enyomba enyia, goika oagache egetango ase ekerama insinyo, erio nario omonto atagwe korwao akwe; okomocha kw’ogokwa kw’omonto oragwe korwao tigokobarerwa enyomba yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa gosimeka chimbusuro chi’ebisaku bibere ase omogondo oo bw’emesabibu; oise gokora bo okwama kwao gwonsi ogw’echio gwasimegete amo nokw’emesabibu nigo korairwe kobe agwo aase Aachenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gokorema, tobaisa gosiberania eng’ombe n’etigere ching’use obokombe amo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa kobeeka eanga eroiseranirie chiusi chi’amarionya na echi’egatani amo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Okore amasugunia, oyabeeke ase emego ene y’eganchwa yao entambe, eria okwambara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko igoro y’okoba omweriiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nenyaare koba ng’a omonto onyuomire omokungu bamenyane, na magega y’ayio amwange,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amosoere ase amang’ana y’obonyaka, erio asarie erieta riaye, ogoteeba: Nigo naira omokungu oyo, na ekero naba nere tindoochi ebimanyererio bi’obwekungi bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onye naboigo, ise na ng’ina omoiseke oria bamoire ase abagaaka b’omochie oria, ase bakogaambera agwo ase egeita, baabarentere ebimanyererio bi’obwekungi bw’omoiseke oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise omoiseke oria akwane n’abagaaka baria, abateebie: ’Naa omonto oyo omoiseke one abe mokaaye, na bono ere omwangire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo osoereire omoiseke oyo one na omorenteire obosooku ogoteeba ng’a taroochi ebimanyererio bi’obwekungi bwaye. Korende rora aa, egetambaa eke nkebwate ebimanyererio bi’obwekungi bwaye. Erio barambore egetambaa keria ase amaiso ’abagaaka b’omochie oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abagaaka b’omochie oria babwate omosacha oria, bamoake ebiranya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende bamonachere aakane, chitaabu, chisekeli chi’echifeta rigana erimo, amoe ise omoiseke oria, ekiagera osaririe erieta ri’omoiseke omwekungi bw’Abaisraeli. Erio oria agenderere koba mokaaye, na omosacha oye tabaisa komotiga nonya ng’ake ase obogima bwaye bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende keraabe ng’a namaene ebimanyererio bi’obwekungi bw’omoiseke oria tibirorekaneti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rirorio bamorente ase egesieri ki’enyomba ya ise, na abanto b’omochie bw’omoiseke oria bamoake amagena akwe, ekiagera orentire obosooku ase egati y’Abaisraeli ase ogokora obonyaka ekero atarasoka. Goika morusie obobe borue ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto omosacha aise konyorekana oraire n’omokuungu bw’omonto onde, bonsi babere, omosacha oria amo n’omokuungu oria, goika baitwe bakwe. Goika morusie obobe borue ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omoiseke omwekungi oriereirwe boko nomonto, karaumerane nomosaacha omoao agwo ase omochie, na omosacha oyio abe nere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mobasokie bonsi babere, mobaire isiko y’egeita ki’omochie, erio mobaake amagena bakwe. Omoiseke oria aitwe, ekiagera atakuurete akonywe, nonya orenge ase omochie ime, na omosacha oria, ekiagera atomana n’omoiseke oriereirwe boko n’omonto omoao. Goika morusie obobe borue ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende omonto karaumerane n’omoiseke omwekungi oriereirwe boko n’omonto omoao amobwate ne chinguru abe nere agwo ase orosana isiko y’omochie, omonto oria nere bweka oraitwe akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timokorera omoiseke oria ing’ana rinde; ere takorete okomocha kogwenerete aitwe, ekiagera amang’ana ayio nigo anga buna ekero omonto akorwania omonto onde omoao na komoita moeneno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio nigo amonyoorete agwo ase orosana, akamorwania ne chinguru. Nonya omoiseke oria okuurete akonywe, monto onde tarengeo okomokoonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto karaumerane n’omoiseke omwekungi otararierwa boko, na komobwata ne chinguru, abe nere, nabarabwo babere banyorwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
